  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> 10 spaces</p><p>You burn your opponent with sparkling blue fires that cause pain without physical damage.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong> and make a <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check, resisted by the target's <strong>Willpower</strong>.</p><p>The target takes <strong>Damage</strong> equal to the difference in successes. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, the target takes a <strong>-1</strong> dice penalty to any <strong>Casting</strong> checks they make until they complete a <strong>Short Rest</strong>.</p><p>If a physical creature is defeated with this ability, it does not die. Rather, it is I<strong>ncapacitated</strong> until it completes a <strong>Long Rest</strong> or is revived by some other effect.</p><p>Nonphysical creatures are destroyed as normal.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.QvkaT5q64x7Nxa6X]{Fox Fire}</p>",
